# Coding standards

Use the ce-code-review agent on a diff. Report findings. Do not auto-merge.

Clerk client code reads the publishable key from `NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`. Document that env var name only. Never print secrets.

```ts
// bad
const publishableKey = "paste-key-here";

// good
const publishableKey = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY;
```

Keep each rule to one concern.
